/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><p>&lt;!-- release-6: UNRELEASED. The package is prepared but not published; do not announce until docs/handover/mcp-publish.md has been run. --&gt;</p>\n<h1 id=\"verse-for-ai-agents-mcp\">Verse for AI agents (MCP)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verse-for-ai-agents-mcp\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<blockquote><p><strong>Early access.</strong> The hosted endpoint at <code>/mcp</code> is live (Bearer key required). The <code>@ctruhtech/verse-mcp</code> npm package is prepared and waiting to be published (see <code>docs/handover/mcp-publish.md</code>).</p></blockquote>\n<p><code>@ctruhtech/verse-mcp</code> is a <a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-model-context-protocol\">Model Context Protocol</a> server. Add it to Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor or VS Code and the assistant can take a 3D file (a path on your machine, or a public URL) and hand you back a Verse link that opens in any browser, plus embed code, private links and a guided tour.</p>\n<p>It does nothing the REST API cannot: each tool is a thin wrapper over <a href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-v1\"><code>/v1/*</code></a> through the <a href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-js-sdk\">JS SDK</a>, including the resumable upload for big files.</p>\n<h2 id=\"install\">Install<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#install\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Stdio (Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Cursor, VS Code), Node 20+:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"json\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-json\">{ &quot;mcpServers&quot;: { &quot;verse&quot;: { &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;, &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;-y&quot;, &quot;@ctruhtech/verse-mcp&quot;], &quot;env&quot;: { &quot;VERSE_API_KEY&quot;: &quot;your account token&quot; } } } }</code></pre></div>\n<p>Remote (Streamable HTTP) at <code>https://verse.ctruh.com/mcp</code>, with <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;your key&gt;</code>. Copy-paste setups for each client are in the package README (<code>sdk/mcp/README.md</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"credentials\">Credentials<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#credentials\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>VERSE_API_KEY</code> takes your <strong>account token</strong> (Studio, <code>/studio</code>) or an upload key <code>vk_...</code> (see <a href=\"/docs/api#authentication\" id=\"lnk-authentication\">Authentication</a>). The account token is what owns scenes and unlocks <code>list_scenes</code>, visibility, private links and camera paths. <code>VERSE_BASE_URL</code> points at another origin. The key is sent only to that origin as a header and never logged or returned.</p>\n<h2 id=\"tools\">Tools<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tools\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>REST routes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>upload_scene</code></td><td><code>POST /v1/ingest</code> or the resumable <code>begin</code> / <code>part</code> / <code>commit</code> (from 100 MB, or on request); <code>POST /v1/ingest/url</code> for URLs; polls <code>GET /v1/ingest/&lt;job&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>get_scene_status</code></td><td><code>GET /v1/ingest/&lt;job&gt;</code>, then <code>GET /v1/account/scenes</code> for older scenes</td></tr><tr><td><code>list_scenes</code></td><td><code>GET /v1/account/scenes</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>create_share_link</code></td><td><code>PATCH /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;</code> (visibility), <code>POST /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;/share</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>revoke_share_link</code></td><td><code>GET</code> / <code>DELETE /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;/share[/&lt;shareId&gt;]</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>get_embed_code</code></td><td>builds the iframe / <code>&lt;verse-viewer&gt;</code> from the scene&#39;s link</td></tr><tr><td><code>list_camera_paths</code>, <code>set_camera_path</code>, <code>reset_auto_camera_path</code></td><td><code>GET</code> / <code>POST /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;/paths</code>, <code>POST .../paths/auto</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Not included, because the API does not offer it: world generation from a prompt or photo, and link expiry (share tokens last until revoked).</p>\n<p>Errors are one plain sentence (the server&#39;s own friendly error where there is one). Large uploads report progress as MCP progress notifications.</p>\n<h2 id=\"remote-server-notes\">Remote server notes<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#remote-server-notes\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The HTTP transport is stateless and bring-your-own-key: each request builds a server bound to the caller&#39;s header. Local file paths are refused (a hosted server cannot see your disk); give it a public URL, or use stdio. It is a Node <code>(req, res)</code> handler (<code>createHttpHandler</code>) or <code>verse-mcp --http</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"for-ai-3d-generators\">For AI 3D generators<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#for-ai-3d-generators\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>integrations/ai-generators/</code> has a tiny JS and Python helper and a &quot;Share as Verse link&quot; button that takes a GLB / PLY / SPZ URL or blob and returns a link and embed code. See its README.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#install\" id=\"lnk-install\">Install</a><a href=\"#credentials\" id=\"lnk-credentials\">Credentials</a><a href=\"#tools\" id=\"lnk-tools\">Tools</a><a href=\"#remote-server-notes\" id=\"lnk-remote-server-notes\">Remote server notes</a><a href=\"#for-ai-3d-generators\" id=\"lnk-for-ai-3d-generators\">For AI 3D generators</a></aside></section>"}